OL,3,AUK national tests positive for Ebola
OL,4,Avirus in DR Congo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Foreign Office did not confirm
OL,7,Fwhether the patient would be brought
OL,8,Fback to the UK for treatment, though a
OL,9,FUK resident who was exposed to the
OL,10,Fvirus in July was flown back for
OL,11,Fmedical attention, as have previous
OL,12,Fnationals infected abroad.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
